{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Ad Blocker Pro 是一款專為 Safari 與內建瀏覽器設計的廣告攔截工具，利用 24 萬條攔截規則與 DNS 保護，帶來更清爽、更快速且更私密的瀏覽體驗。適合不想看到廣告、重視私隱與節省流量的用戶，原價 US $4.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>廣告攔截與私隱保護</h2>\n<p>Ad Blocker Pro 在 Safari 與內建瀏覽器中套用 24 萬條攔截規則，橫幅、影片廣告與彈出視窗在載入前已被擋下。DNS 保護會攔截已知追蹤器網域，並加密 DNS 查詢，避免第三方得知瀏覽足跡。內建瀏覽器另有私密分頁、手勢操作與電腦版網頁，全面提升瀏覽速度與私隱保障。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-193-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-194-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-195-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-196-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-197-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-198-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Ad Blocker Pro: Safari &amp; DNS</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T03:41:00.874123+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}